WEBVTT

00:38:31.113 --> 00:38:32.609
Siri: Thanks for listening.

00:38:33.571 --> 00:38:36.355
CM: We just, this weekend,

00:38:36.379 --> 00:38:37.688
picked up a few puppies.

00:38:37.712 --> 00:38:39.362
The dog that we thought we wanted,

00:38:39.386 --> 00:38:42.366
turns out to be clearly not
the one to keep us the pair.

00:38:42.390 --> 00:38:43.655
And we only got that,

00:38:43.679 --> 00:38:45.911
by living with those dogs
for a couple of days.

00:38:45.935 --> 00:38:47.086
AG: Wow, you know, Cade,

00:38:47.110 --> 00:38:50.077
if only you had
a dog-selection algorithm --

00:38:50.101 --> 00:38:51.609
CM: I would have screwed it up.

00:38:51.633 --> 00:38:54.069
AG: You would've been able
to avoid those few days.

00:38:54.093 --> 00:38:55.909
CM: You want the workplace sample.